[line]

[size=5]🎮 How Effects Work[/size]

Each interaction has a [b]type[/b] that determines what happens to the target crop:

[code]
Effect Type         | ✅ Positive                                            | ❌ Negative
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
⚡ Growth Speed     | Advances growth phase                                 | Delays day progress in current phase
⭐ Quality          | Applies/upgrades fertilizer (Basic → Quality → Deluxe)| Downgrades/removes fertilizer
📦 Quantity         | Advances growth (more harvest cycles)                 | Resets day progress (fewer harvests)
💧 Default          | Auto-waters dry soil                                  | Dries out watered soil
[/code]

Effects are processed [b]once at the start of each day[/b] and [b]every 2 in-game hours[/b]. Each effect has a random chance to trigger based on the interaction's strength multiplied by your configured Effect Strength.

[line]

[size=5]⚙️ Configuration[/size]

All options can be changed via [b]Generic Mod Config Menu[/b] or by editing [font=Courier New]config.json[/font]:

[code]
Option                | Default  | Description
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
EnableMod             | true     | Enable or disable the mod
EffectStrength        | 0.5      | Global multiplier for all effects (0.0 – 1.0)
ShowEffectMessages    | true     | Show in-game messages when interactions occur
ShowParticleEffects   | true     | Show sparkle particles on affected crops
ShowHoverText         | true     | Show tooltip when hovering over affected crops
[/code]

[line]

[size=5]📥 Installation[/size]

[list=1]
[*]Install [url=https://smapi.io/]SMAPI[/url] (4.0+)
[*][i](Optional)[/i] Install [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/5098]Generic Mod Config Menu[/url] for in-game configuration
[*]Download this mod and unzip it into your [font=Courier New]Stardew Valley/Mods[/font] folder
[*]Launch the game through SMAPI
[/list]

[line]

[size=5]🔧 Compatibility[/size]

[list]
[*]✅ Stardew Valley [b]1.6+[/b]
[*]✅ Windows, macOS, and Linux
[*]✅ Single-player and multiplayer
[*]✅ Compatible with most other mods
[*]✅ Works on Farm, Greenhouse, and Ginger Island
[/list]

[b]🌿 Modded crops[/b] — allelopathy rules are included for these, and switch on automatically when the mod is installed:
[list]
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/24842]Cornucopia - More Crops[/url] — legumes feed their neighbours, alliums repel pests but stunt beans, fennel poisons almost everything near it, basil pairs with tomatoes, dill guards cabbage, mint crowds out lettuce
[*][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/27049]Wildflour's Atelier Goods[/url] — the aromatic herbs (basil, rosemary, sage, thyme, lavender, chamomile, mint) shelter their neighbours from pests, while wormwood stunts anything planted around it
[/list]

[line]

[size=5]🌐 Supported Languages[/size]

[list]
[*]✅ English (default)
[*]✅ Português (Brazilian)
[/list]

Want to help translate? Create a new file in the [font=Courier New]i18n[/font] folder following the [url=https://stardewvalleywiki.com/Modding:Translations]SMAPI translation guide[/url].

[line]

[size=5]💡 Tips for Players[/size]

[list]
[*]🫘 [b]Green Beans are your best friend[/b] — They fix nitrogen and benefit ALL nearby crops. Plant them everywhere!
[*]🌻 [b]Sunflowers and Fairy Roses are area buffers[/b] — They help all crops in a 2-tile radius
[*]🍓 [b]Don't mass-plant strawberries[/b] — They compete with each other when too close
[*]🎃 [b]Isolate your pumpkins[/b] — They drain nutrients from everything nearby
[*]💠 [b]Give Sweet Gem Berries space[/b] — Any crop next to them causes negative effects
[*]☕ [b]Coffee is a great neighbor[/b] — Stimulates growth in all nearby plants
[*]🧄🍓 [b]Garlic + Strawberry[/b] is one of the strongest positive combos in spring
[/list]

